Table full name: FINANCE__ECONOMICS.CYBERSYN.COMPANY_INDEX
Column name: PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The exchange name for the primary trading venue of a security.
Column name: PRIMARY_TICKER Type: TEXT Description: The ticker for the primary trading venue of a security. If a security trades on multiple exchanges or has numerous tickers, an attempt is made to select the ticker from the home market.
Column name: ENTITY_LEVEL Type: TEXT Description: Describes the type or level of the entity for additional convenience. Currently, all entities are corporate entities and are denoted as 'Corporate'.
Column name: PERMID_COMPANY_ID Type: TEXT Description: Permanent Identifier, which is a identifier provided by Refinitiv (via PermID) to provide a way to uniquely identify a company.
Column name: LEI Type: ARRAY Description: Legal Entity Identifier, a unique identifier from GLEIF that identifies legal entities that engage in financial transactions.
Column name: COMPANY_ID Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier assigned by Cybersyn to each company.
Column name: EIN Type: TEXT Description: Employer Identification Number, a unique identification number that is assigned to a business by the IRS.
Column name: PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_CODE Type: TEXT Description: The exchange code for the primary trading venue of a security.
Column name: GLOBAL_TICKERS Type: ARRAY Description: An array of ticker symbols under which the security may be traded globally on all exchanges.
Column name: COMPANY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The name of the company.
Column name: CIK Type: TEXT Description: Central Index Key, a unique identifier for corporations registered with the United States Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC).
Sample rows:
[{'COMPANY_ID': '9cee45c58a4fdb6bb265552a0db62a00', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'VENDERA RESOURCES VI-A LP', 'ENTITY_LEVEL': 'Corporate', 'EIN': None, 'CIK': '0002011467', 'LEI': None, 'PERMID_COMPANY_ID': '5087020389', 'PRIMARY_TICKER': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_CODE': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_NAME': None, 'GLOBAL_TICKERS': None}, {'COMPANY_ID': '7766ef904f8648e8b8ac520b7267d5b5', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'RT-AI I LLC', 'ENTITY_LEVEL': 'Corporate', 'EIN': None, 'CIK': '0002018929', 'LEI': None, 'PERMID_COMPANY_ID': '5087193531', 'PRIMARY_TICKER': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_CODE': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_NAME': None, 'GLOBAL_TICKERS': None}, {'COMPANY_ID': 'bfd8994995275e9917290bc423536fd6', 'COMPANY_NAME': 'PANTHEON GLOBAL SECONDARY FUND III B L P', 'ENTITY_LEVEL': 'Corporate', 'EIN': None, 'CIK': '0001371639', 'LEI': None, 'PERMID_COMPANY_ID': '4297623383', 'PRIMARY_TICKER': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_CODE': None, 'PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_NAME': None, 'GLOBAL_TICKERS': None}, {'COMPANY_ID': '878d19cbba19e94e8645afbabd4a


