Table full name: FINANCE__ECONOMICS.CYBERSYN.FINANCIAL_INSTITUTION_ENTITIES
Column name: ADDRESS Type: TEXT Description: Stree-level address of the bank
Column name: STATE_ABBREVIATION Type: TEXT Description: State of the bank
Column name: NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the bank
Column name: ID_COUNTRY Type: TEXT Description: A unique geographic identifier for the country where the bank is located
Column name: NAICS_CODE Type: TEXT Description: NAICS code of the primary activity conducted by an entity.
Column name: ID_STATE Type: TEXT Description: A unique geographic identifier for the state where the bank is located
Column name: ID_ZIP Type: TEXT Description: A unique geographic identifier for the zip code where the bank is located
Column name: FEDERAL_REGULATOR Type: TEXT Description: The abbreviation for the banking regulator (OCC, FED, FDIC)
Column name: LEGAL_ENTITY_IDENTIFIER Type: TEXT Description: Code to identify a legally distinct entity that engages in a financial transaction. Issued by approved local operating units around the world in conjunction with the Global LEI Foundation.
Column name: FDIC_CERT Type: NUMBER Description: A unique identifier for the financial institution assigned by the FDIC
Column name: SPECIALIZATION_GROUP Type: TEXT Description: Specialization Group from FDIC, defined as Asset Concentration Hierarchy (e.g., Agricultural Specialization)
Column name: ZIP_CODE Type: TEXT Description: Zip code of the bank
Column name: REASON_FOR_ENTITY_TERMINATION Type: NUMBER Description: The circumstances under which an entity ceased to exist or an indicator that an entity failed but remained open.
Column name: ID_COUNTY Type: TEXT Description: A unique geographic identifier for the county where the bank is located
Column name: START_DATE Type: TIMESTAMP_NTZ Description: First date for which the bank was open
Column name: EMPLOYER_IDENTIFICATION_NUMBER Type: TEXT Description: Employer identification number (EIN), a number assigned to a business by the Internal Revenue Service, effective 2008-12-31.
Column name: INSURER Type: TEXT Description: Indicates whether an institution is insured under the Deposit Insurance Fund (DIF).
Column name: CHARTERING_AUTHORITY Type: TEXT Description: The level of the chartering agency of the institution (State, Federal)
Column name: MAJORITY_OWNED_BY_MINORITY_OR_WOMEN Type: TEXT Description: Indicates whether the entity is more than 50% owned by one or more minorities or women with identification of the minority. If the ownership is by a woman who is also a member of a minority, the item is coded as minority. Not all codes provided by the FFIEC data were mapped in the reference data
Column name: END_DATE Type: TIMESTAMP_NTZ Description: Last date for which the bank was open. NULL if still active
Column name: ENTITY_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: The institution grouping for the bank (National Bank, Non-member Bank, etc.)
Column name: IS_ACTIVE Type: BOOLEAN Description: Status of the bank to determine active or closed
Column name: THRIFT_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier for the financial institution assigned by the Office of Thrift Supervision, last 5 characters only
Column name: ID_RSSD Type: NUMBER Description: A unique identifier assigned by the Federal Reserve for the financial institution
Column name: CITY Type: TEXT Description: City of the bank
Column name: CATEGORY Type: TEXT Description: Category for the entity
Column name: CHARTER_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: The particular charter assigned to the bank (Industrial Bank, Commercial Bank, etc.)
Column name: INTERNATIONAL_BANKING_FACILITY Type: BOOLEAN Description: Indicates whether an entity has an International Banking Facility.
Column name: URL Type: TEXT Description: Link to the bank website
Column name: OCC_ID Type: NUMBER Description: A unique identifier for the financial institution assigned by the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency
Sample rows:
[{'ID_RSSD': 2849463, 'NAME': 'First Capital Bank', 'CATEGORY': 'Bank', 'IS_ACTIVE': True, 'ADDRESS': '304 Meeting St', 'CITY': 'Charleston', 'STATE_ABBREVIATION': 'SC', 'ZIP_CODE': '29401', 'URL': 'www.fcbcarolinas.com', 'START_DATE': '1999-09-27 00:00:00', 'END_DATE': None, 'CHARTERING_AUTHORITY': 'State', 'CHARTER_TYPE': 'Commercial Bank', 'FEDERAL_REGULATOR': 'FDIC', 'ENTITY_TYPE': 'State Member Bank', 'INSURER': 'DIF', 'FDIC_CERT': 34966, 'OCC_ID': nan, 'THRIFT_ID': None, 'ID_COUNTRY': 'country/USA', 'ID_STATE': 'geoId/45', 'ID_COUNTY': 'geoId/45019', 'ID_ZIP': 'zip/29401', 'LEGAL_ENTITY_IDENTIFIER': '254900LDLCTUL5TXVH85', 'EMPLOYER_IDENTIFICATION_NUMBER': '571084848', 'REASON_FOR_ENTITY_TERMINATION': None, 'INTERNATIONAL_BANKING_FACILITY': False, 'NAICS_CODE': '52211', 'MAJORITY_OWNED_BY_MINORITY_OR_WOMEN': None, 'SPECIALIZATION_GROUP': 'Commercial Lending Specialization'}, {'ID_RSSD': 3595271, 'NAME': 'The Bank of Princeton', 'CATEGORY': 'Bank', 'IS_ACTIVE': True, 'ADDRESS': '1


