Table full name: FINANCE__ECONOMICS.CYBERSYN.PERMID_SECURITY_INDEX
Column name: ASSET_CLASS Type: TEXT Description: Broad-based class of the asset, such as 'Ordinary Shares', 'Depositary Receipts', etc.
Column name: EXCHANGE_CODE Type: ARRAY Description: An array of codes representing the exchanges where the security is traded. An empty array means that exchange information is not available.
Column name: PRIMARY_TICKER Type: TEXT Description: The ticker for the primary trading venue of a security. If a security trades on multiple exchanges or has numerous tickers, an attempt is made to select the ticker from the home market.
Column name: SECURITY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the security.
Column name: PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_CODE Type: TEXT Description: The exchange code for the primary trading venue of a security.
Column name: SECURITY_STATUS Type: TEXT Description: Status of the security, i.e. 'Active' or 'Inactive'. An active security is a security that has active quotes and an inactive security has no active quotes. This status changes over time.
Column name: GLOBAL_TICKERS Type: ARRAY Description: An array of ticker symbols under which the security may be traded globally on all exchanges.
Column name: PERMID_SECURITY_ID Type: TEXT Description: PermID for the security.
Column name: PRIMARY_EXCHANGE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The exchange name for the primary trading venue of a security.
Column name: PERMID_QUOTE_ID Type: ARRAY Description: An array of PermIDs for the quotes for each exchange where the security is traded. An empty array means that quote information is not available.
