Table full name: FINANCE__ECONOMICS.CYBERSYN.COMPANY_RELATIONSHIPS
Column name: COMPANY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The name of the company.
Column name: RELATIONSHIP_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Specifies the kind of relationship between the company and the related company. The value is 'Parent' when the company is the parent of the related company and 'Subsidiary' when the company is a subsidiary of the related company.
Column name: RELATIONSHIP_START_DATE Type: DATE Description: The beginning of a company being associated with the related company. In cases where the start date is unknown, NULL is assigned.
Column name: RELATIONSHIP_END_DATE Type: DATE Description: The ending of the relationship being valid for the company and the related company. In cases where a relationship is currently valid, an end date of NULL is assigned.
Column name: COMPANY_ID Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier assigned by Cybersyn to each company. Joinable to the COMPANY_INDEX table.
Column name: ENTITY_LEVEL Type: TEXT Description: Describes the type or level of the entity for additional convenience. Currently, all entities are corporate entities and are denoted as 'Corporate'.
Column name: RELATED_COMPANY_ID Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier assigned by Cybersyn to the related company. Joinable to the COMPANY_INDEX table.
Column name: RELATED_ENTITY_LEVEL Type: TEXT Description: Describes the type or level of the related entity for additional convenience. Currently, all entities are corporate entities and are denoted as 'Corporate'.
Column name: RELATED_COMPANY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: The name of the related company.
