Table full name: FINANCE__ECONOMICS.CYBERSYN.FINANCIAL_CFPB_COMPLAINT
Column name: DATE_SENT_TO_COMPANY Type: DATE Description: Date the CFPB sent the complaint to the company
Column name: TIMELY_RESPONSE Type: BOOLEAN Description: Indicates whether the company gave a timely response
Column name: SUBMITTED_VIA Type: TEXT Description: How the complaint was submitted
Column name: ZIP_CODE Type: TEXT Description: mailing zip code provided by the consumer
Column name: SUB_ISSUE Type: TEXT Description: type of sub-issue identified by the consumer in the complaint.  The categorical sub-issues available for selection have evolved over time
Column name: ID_STATE Type: TEXT Description: a unique identifier of the mailing state provided by the consumer
Column name: DATE_RECEIVED Type: DATE Description: Date the CFPB received the complaint
Column name: COMPANY_PUBLIC_RESPONSE Type: TEXT Description: The optional, public-facing response to a consumer complaint chosen by the company from a list
Column name: CONSUMER_COMPLAINT_NARRATIVE Type: TEXT Description: The consumer-submitted description of the complaint, with PII scrubbed by the CFPB.  Consumers must opt-in and can opt out at any time
Column name: STATE Type: TEXT Description: mailing state provided by the consumer
Column name: ID_ZIP Type: TEXT Description: a unique identifier of the mailing zip code provided by the consumer
Column name: COMPANY Type: TEXT Description: Company identified by the consumer in the complaint.
Column name: SUB_PRODUCT Type: TEXT Description: type of sub-product identified by the consumer in the complaint.  Sub-product categories were consolidated by the CFPB in 2017
Column name: ISSUE Type: TEXT Description: type of issue identified by the consumer in the complaint.  The categorical issues available for selection have evolved over time
Column name: COMPANY_RESPONSE_TO_CONSUMER Type: TEXT Description: Company explanation of how the issue was closed, selected from a list
Column name: CONSUMER_DISPUTED Type: TEXT Description: Whether the consumer disputed the company response.  After April 24, 2017 the Bureau discontinued this option and this field is marked N/A
Column name: CONSUMER_CONSENT_PROVIDED Type: TEXT Description: Identifies consumer consent in publishing their complaint narrative
Column name: PRODUCT Type: TEXT Description: type of product identified by the consumer in the complaint.  Product categories were consolidated by the CFPB in 2017
Column name: TAGS Type: TEXT Description: Categorical data supporting easier searching of complaints submitted by or on behalf of consumers, includes "Older American" and "Servicemember"
